Error [E0302]: `Machine.Off` is not a value
  --> tests/ui/typestate_name_not_value.jet:10:19
    |
 10 |     print(Machine.Off)
    |                   ^^^
 Why: struct fields need a value before the dot; typestate names are compile-time facts, not runtime values
 Fix: use a `Machine` value before a field, or call a static method on `Machine`
